{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>網上流傳一段影片，有網民於元朗一間酒家食飯期間，驚見一隻老鼠竟於出菜櫃枱上大搖大擺地遊走。片中所見，當時櫃枱上放有餐具及飲品，但老鼠感覺毫不怕人，不時左望右望、四處穿梭，期間老鼠更一度不慎失足跌落地面，隨後迅速走入餐桌底部逃離現場。</p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-10-16-14h45m31s889.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026vZuN7BVbn81792133468.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-10-16-14h46m17s604.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026ehQw5E0pK81792133475.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-10-16-14h46m21s332.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026qPPwlH6tRZ1792133482.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p>影片隨即引爆網民熱烈討論，不少人直言畫面極度恐怖，大批網民擔憂老鼠踩過餐具及枱面，其毛髮、足部、口水甚至是排泄物，會嚴重污染食具及接觸食物的表面，引發衛生隱患。網民紛紛留言表達不滿與擔心：「無職員見到😳可否棄單唔食」、「佢哋識得經天花版走來走去」，更有人直言事態嚴重，呼籲「直接報食環啦」。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T07:41:40.002539+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":262,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T06:50:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T08:58:07.620977+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T07:37:54.172566+00:00","content_hash":"622586406ff141e48b7b33c41d6b67869ffc2e15802d5834667b2d87127bc4c1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}